Why this is faster than the previous answer:

The previous version vectorized over kx (15-wide) with a cross-lane reduction, which clang must lower to horizontal adds every 15 iterations. Here the reduction is gone — each lane is independent, so the inner loop is pure FMA with no reduction overhead.

